# Build context for `.buildkite/Dockerfile` (see the `build-ci-image` step).
#
# The Dockerfile only copies mise.toml and mise.lock, but without this file the
# daemon would still tar the whole working tree as the build context — which
# includes a multi-gigabyte `target/` directory.
.git/
.idea/
.pi/
__pycache__/
benchmark-results/
lcov.info
target/
THIRDPARTY.yml
